&lt;li&gt;Excellence in strategic planning, business operations, and program management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to balance strategic thinking with tactical execution, and a willingness to concentrate effort rather than spread thin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with technical products and translating complex capabilities into business value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel up to 25% of the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
