&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of enterprise partnerships, alliances, or business development experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience working with AWS or another hyperscaler&#39;s public sector partner organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of public sector partner operating models, including practice structures, delivery economics, and how services and contract revenue drive partner decisions&lt;/li&gt;
