&lt;li&gt;Setting the operating cadence of the function: intake and prioritization of legal work, service expectations with internal clients, and reporting on workload and risk to the leadership team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning public-market readiness on the legal side: corporate governance, group and entity structure, delegated authority, policies, disclosure controls and records, in partnership with Finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advising the CEO, COO, CFO and the Board, and supporting in Board and committee meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning the commercial contracting framework: standard templates, negotiating positions, and a deviation and escalation process that makes commitments visible before they are signed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading intellectual property and open source licensing strategy, including copyleft, trademark and the terms on which Ubuntu and our products are distributed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning the global compliance programme: data protection and privacy, export controls and trade compliance, anti-bribery and corruption, competition and AI regulation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing litigation, disputes and regulatory engagement, together with the external counsel panel, its budget and its quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advising on M&amp;amp;A, partnerships, strategic alliances and financing as the company grows.&lt;/li&gt;
