&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role entails&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with HR, Accounting, Accounts Payable, Treasury, Financial Planning &amp;amp; Analysis, and external payroll providers to support payroll operations and compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage end-to-end payroll operations across different countries, ensuring accurate and timely payroll processing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review, validate, and approve payrolls prior to final processing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain strong payroll controls to ensure data accuracy, compliance, and operational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform payroll and salary cost analyses, investigating and explaining variances&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with all applicable payroll tax, statutory, reporting, and employment-related requirements across jurisdictions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary point of contact for payroll-related audits, coordinating responses to internal and external audit requests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor legislative and regulatory changes that may impact payroll processes, controls, or compliance obligations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous improvement initiatives to enhance payroll accuracy, scalability, and the employee experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continue to develop, document, and maintain payroll policies, procedures, and internal controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain strong relationships with payroll vendors and service providers, ensuring service levels and deliverables are met&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incorporate industry best practices, emerging technology, including AI, to improve reporting quality, efficiency, and accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor and coach a team of global payroll professionals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with internal policies and regulatory requirements while identifying and managing compliance risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for in you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An exceptional academic track record from both high school and university&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An undergraduate degree in Accounting or Finance, or a compelling narrative about your alternative chosen path&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant payroll experience supporting multi-country and/or global payroll operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of payroll compliance, taxation, and internal controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing payroll audits and regulatory requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with payroll systems, HRIS platforms, and spreadsheet-based analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, problem-solving, and reconciliation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership and commitment to skills development and mentorship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The work ethic and confidence to shine alongside motivated colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of going above-and-beyond expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional written and spoken English with excellent presentation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal skills, curiosity, flexibility, and accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Appreciative of diversity, polite, and effective in a multi-cultural, multi-national organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thoughtfulness and self-motivation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Result-oriented, with a personal drive to meet commitments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel internationally twice a year for company events up to two weeks long&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition we expect that you will match our values, by being:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Precise, taking care to deliver correctness and clarity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reliable, delivering high quality work that builds trust and confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accessible, collaborating to build products and systems that are usable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adroit, blending enthusiasm, knowledge, adaptability, style and character&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-have skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing or optimizing payroll platforms and HRIS systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Payroll management experience in publicly traded or pre-IPO companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for technology and a desire to work with motivated colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
