&lt;li&gt;Design, implement and document system level Go code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model data, design database schema and implement data storage in a dqlite (SQL) database&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain code quality through static analysis, unit and system tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate proactively with a distributed team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discuss ideas and collaborate on finding good solutions&lt;/li&gt;
