&lt;li&gt;Provide commercial analysis, develop growth targets, and evaluate strategic initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with product managers to produce, aggregate, and distribute both market insights and competitive intelligence&lt;/li&gt;
