&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Discuss business needs with prospects and develop formal quotes, written sales proposals, or sales presentations that address those needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Coordinate pre- and post-sales engineering and support resources to ensure successful rollout and adoption of GitLab products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;8&quot;&gt;Deepen your knowledge of the industry and GitLab&#39;s competitive position, contribute to root cause analysis of wins and losses, and share lessons with account managers, marketing, and technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
