&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in Solutions Architect, Sales Engineer, Technical Account Manager or equivalent roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with common LLM frameworks and tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in artificial intelligence, machine learning, or data science&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing scalable cloud architectures and integrating with enterprise systems&lt;/li&gt;
